Lin:     45665 ns/tx  (21899 tx/sec)
SQLite:  21349 ns/tx  (46841 tx/sec)

--- 4. Interactive Bank Transfer (Read -> Validate -> 2 Updates -> Commit) ---
Lin:      1311 ns/tx  (762777 tx/sec)
SQLite:   2928 ns/tx  (341530 tx/sec)

